{"seq":3,"slug":"k8s-workloads","title":"工作负载管理","docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-workloads","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"deployments","title":"Deployment 与 ReplicaSet","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-workloads/deployments","wordCount":1460,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"stateful-apps","title":"有状态应用管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-workloads/stateful-apps","wordCount":1406,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"jobs-cronjobs","title":"Job 与 CronJob","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-workloads/jobs-cronjobs","wordCount":1417,"readingTime":6},{"seq":4,"slug":"pods-deployments","title":"Pod 与 Deployment 实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-workloads/pods-deployments","wordCount":1463,"readingTime":6},{"seq":5,"slug":"statefulsets","title":"StatefulSet 与有状态应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-workloads/statefulsets","wordCount":1464,"readingTime":6},{"seq":6,"slug":"services-networking","title":"Service 与网络策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-workloads/services-networking","wordCount":1345,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 工作负载管理 简介\n\n本章聚焦 Kubernetes 的核心工作负载类型，从基础的 Pod 管理到有状态应用的编排，再到批处理任务的调度，帮助读者掌握在 Kubernetes 上运行不同类型应用的方法。\n\n**Pod 与 Deployment 管理**讲解 Pod 的生命周期与配置要点，深入 Deployment 的滚动更新、回滚策略和扩缩容机制，以及 ReplicaSet 的副本管理原理。\n\n**有状态应用与 StatefulSet**分析有状态应用在容器环境中的特殊需求，介绍 StatefulSet 提供的稳定网络标识、有序部署和持久存储绑定能力。\n\n**Job 与 CronJob 调度**讲解一次性任务和定时任务在 Kubernetes 中的实现方式，分析并行度控制、失败重试和完成策略的配置方法。\n\n建议读者从最常用的 Deployment 模式开始实践，掌握无状态应用的管理后再挑战 StatefulSet 的复杂场景，最后学习任务调度以完善工作负载管理能力。\n"}